  "description": "Operating Area: Miami, Florida, USA & The Bahamas\n\nThe 65ft Prestige 630 Fly (2019, refit 2026) blends French elegance with spacious, comfortable cruising, departing from Bill Bird Marina in North Miami. Powered by twin Volvo diesel engines, she offers a smooth, stable ride ideal for exploring Biscayne Bay and beyond.\n\nBelow deck, the Prestige 630 offers a 3-cabin layout with 3 bathrooms, comfortably sleeping up to 6 overnight guests plus 2 crew, while her expansive flybridge and open salon create generous space for entertaining both above and below deck.",
